    "summary": "The case concerns the shooting of 15\u2011year\u2011old Sergio Hernandez, who was standing on Mexican soil when a U.S. Border Patrol agent, located inside the United States, shot and killed him. The petitioners argue that the conduct occurred inside the United States and therefore the Fourth Amendment\u2019s limits on deadly force and a Bivens claim should apply. The respondent contends that the Fourth Amendment does not reach conduct that occurs on foreign soil.",
